    <h1>Stance Control Orthosis</h1>
    <p class="lead">A wearable knee orthosis that locks and unlocks the knee joint based on the wearer's gait phase. I built the sensor fusion, the gait-phase state machine, and the encoder and IMU processing that drive it in real time.</p>

    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Role</div><div class="v">Team member, primary firmware</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Timeline</div><div class="v">Jan 2025 to present</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Platform</div><div class="v">Arduino, IMU, magnetic encoder</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="k">Status</div><div class="v">In development</div></div>
    </div>
